@startuml
title Return request - UC-007
actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database PostgreSQL
User -> Frontend : Submit ownership explanation
Frontend -> Backend : Send return request
Backend -> Backend : Check identity and input
alt Not signed in or invalid input
 Backend --> Frontend : Reject request
 Frontend --> User : Show error
else Identity and input valid
 Backend -> PostgreSQL : Read item and existing requests
 PostgreSQL --> Backend : Item and request data
 alt Item unavailable, own item or existing active request
  Backend --> Frontend : Reject request
  Frontend --> User : Show reason
 else Request allowed
  Backend -> PostgreSQL : Save request (pending)
  alt Save successful
   PostgreSQL --> Backend : Saved request
   Backend --> Frontend : Confirm submission
   Frontend --> User : Show pending status
  else Save failed
   PostgreSQL --> Backend : Storage error
   Backend --> Frontend : Submission failed
   Frontend --> User : Show error, no success confirmation
  end
 end
end
@enduml
